==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 13 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Raichu ex Drop Event]], which ran from October 6 to 16, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Pikachu|71}} from the {{TCG|Arceus}} expansion.
*{{m|Quick Attack}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Pikachu}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

